<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="sr">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <title>Nova poruka sa kontakt forme</title>
</head>
<body style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: #333; line-height: 1.5;">
    <h2 style="margin-bottom: 0.5em;">Nova poruka sa kontakt forme</h2>

    <table cellpadding="6" cellspacing="0" style="border-collapse: collapse;">
        <tr>
            <td style="font-weight: bold;">Ime i prezime:</td>
            <td>{{ data.name }}</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td style="font-weight: bold;">Email:</td>
            <td><a href="mailto:{{ data.email }}">{{ data.email }}</a></td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td style="font-weight: bold;">Tema:</td>
            <td>{{ data.subject }}</td>
        </tr>
    </table>

    <h3 style="margin-top: 1.5em;">Poruka</h3>
    <p>{{ data.message|e|nl2br }}</p>

    <hr>
    <p style="font-size: 12px; color: #888;">
        Poruka poslata kroz kontakt formu sajta smestaj.
    </p>
</body>
</html>
